s there to serve and who is there to plunder so they decided to block the roads into affected areas and perhaps start disarming every single one that is not there in official capacity?</p>\n<p>I bet he is correct and there are lot of people in positions that are completely incompetent, corrupt to the bone and down outright anti-American but to put complete FED law enforcement and FEMA into that group is preposterous. </p>\n<p>Globalist circus monkey paraded as president actually did a good job and all he could in time of crisis. But the dirty work was done by national guard, ordinary citizens, charitable organizations, law enforcement from top to bottom etc. At least to me, watching those people in TX, all races,creeds and colors working together to save lives, was a beacon of hope that this country is still salvageable. </p>"],[1,10573491,0,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T05:06:37","SensibleStoner","",[],"<p>Is this real life?</p>"],[2,10573812,10573491,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T06:10:47","Sueshia101","",[],"<p>Yes it is.</p>"],[1,10573719,0,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T05:50:29","LCCVC","",[],"<p>TLDW?</p>"],[2,10573816,10573719,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T06:11:20","Sueshia101","",[],"<p>Sorry...what are you saying?</p>"],[3,10573950,10573816,1,0,1,"2017-09-22T06:39:04","Fibbideh","",[],"<p>Too long; didn't watch.</p>\n<p>He's asking for a quick synopsis.</p>"]]
