[[0,2144738,0,13,0,13,"2017-09-22T02:48:01","discoball","",[],"","Screenshot of the original Silk Road, just a few weeks after it opened. (found in archives)","https://imgoat.com/uploads/9d4f495e87/45026.png","pics"],[1,10572486,0,6,0,6,"2017-09-22T02:53:28","truthbeloathed","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://voat.co/v/aww\">/v/aww</a></p>\n<p>Just adorable</p>"],[1,10572511,0,50,0,50,"2017-09-22T02:55:53","discoball","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>1 BTC = 0.85 USD</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Man, those were the days.</p>"],[2,10572678,10572511,15,0,15,"2017-09-22T03:13:35","Doorsopenm8","",[],"<p>For a second there I was thinking 35btc for an 1/8 of weed. That's like 127000 dollars now </p>"],[3,10573928,10572678,2,0,2,"2017-09-22T06:32:53","Slayfire122","",[],"<p>Must be prison prices. </p>"],[3,10574918,10572678,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T11:29:53","10574918","[A]",[],"<p>Was the first thing I saw too. At that price that better be the best weed I've ever had!</p>"],[2,10573325,10572511,3,0,3,"2017-09-22T04:38:33","DependasaurusRex","",[],"<p>I had a security clearance when I found out about them when they were 0.10 USD. Wanted to keep it, so I avouded buying into it so I wouldn't lose it. Next thing I know, just before I get out of the military, the Chinks were buying them for 2k+... makes me a sad panda...</p>"],[3,10573996,10573325,2,0,2,"2017-09-22T06:47:54","Slayfire122","",[],"<p>That $70 I sent Voat is now worth over $600. I wish I invested in it back then instead of losing interest in it. </p>"],[4,10574040,10573996,3,0,3,"2017-09-22T06:56:42","fartyshorts","",[],"<p>I was going to buy 100 BTC back when it was like $5 a pop, but I decided to go on holiday instead. Would have been a hell of a holiday now!</p>"],[4,10574565,10573996,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T09:56:07","l_voated_today","",[],"<p>Nah, you would have sold it for $140 and spent your earnings on beer.</p>"],[1,10572560,0,8,0,8,"2017-09-22T03:01:37","undertheshills","",[],"<p>106k seems pretty steep for 5 grams of shrooms.</p>"],[1,10572605,0,1,0,1,"2017-09-22T03:06:20","Reverse-Flash","",[],"<p>Is there a doctor in the house?</p>"],[1,10573422,0,7,1,6,"2017-09-22T04:54:03","dontforgetaboutevil","",[],"<p>It sucks that people cant just buy what they want.</p>"],[2,10574683,10573422,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T10:38:23","Cat-hax","",[],"<p>But but the children /s</p>"],[1,10573724,0,4,0,4,"2017-09-22T05:51:37","ankakot","",[],"<p>I wish I had bought btc when I first found out about it. </p>"],[2,10574340,10573724,5,0,5,"2017-09-22T08:36:43","Baconmon","",[],"<p>Literally like every person that knows about bitcoin always thinks that same thing.. &quot;I missed the boat!&quot;..<br />\nBut the thing is, if your future self from like 7 years in the future came back to visit you right now, he would be saying &quot;Holy shit, 1 bitcoin is only worth $4000?!? You need to buy some of that shit, because in my time it is worth $250,000!&quot;<br />\nLook at the average annual returns of the major cryptocurrencies; it is ridiculous.. There is still some serious money to be made..</p>"],[3,10574680,10574340,1,0,1,"2017-09-22T10:37:05","Cat-hax","[e]",[],"<p>So true. But back then I could afford 100$ of BTC, right now I can't afford 4k of it.</p>"],[4,10574729,10574680,3,0,3,"2017-09-22T10:50:52","Baconmon","",[],"<p>lol How do you think people buy stuff with bitcoins?.. You think they just look for stuff worth $4000 or higher?<br />\n&quot;ah crap, I want to buy this candy bar, but all I have are these $4000 bitcoins noooooooooo!&quot;<br />\nbitcoin has 8 decimal places.. The moar you know! ;P</p>"],[3,10575108,10574340,4,0,4,"2017-09-22T12:05:20","TheCompanionCube","",[],"<p>This is risky AF now. There are governments all over the first world creating laws to ban, undermine, or outlaw cryptocurr</p>"],[4,10582013,10575108,0,0,0,"2017-09-23T00:04:34","GoatEmperorTrump","",[],"<p>You are correct. All China had to do was burp about bitcoin and it lost 20% of its value in a few days.</p>\n<p>If any other major nation clamps down, it will halve in value and stay there for quite a while. Very risky investment at this valuation imo.</p>"],[4,10583089,10575108,0,0,0,"2017-09-23T02:15:16","Baconmon","",[],"<p>Governments are definitely going to try their damnedest to stop cryptocurrencies, so whether that ends up making cryptocurrencies worthless or they continue gaining value in spite of the governments is up to the individual to speculate on..</p>\n<p>I personally think cryptocurrencies have already gained too much traction already to be shoved back in the bottle.. They just allow too much freedom of money for the people and I don't think the people are willing to give that up.. I think it would be almost like governments trying to take away the internet; no matter how much they might want to, or how many threats they make, the internet is here to stay.. Just my opinion though, so who knows I could be wrong; maybe cryptocurrencies are just a fad and every one will go back to using good old fiat again..</p>"],[1,10573900,0,4,0,4,"2017-09-22T06:25:48","PotatoPatriarchy","",[],"<p>There's a good chance one of those shroom dealers is ross ulbricht </p>"],[1,10573930,0,1,0,1,"2017-09-22T06:33:49","BentAxel","",[],"<p>If someone can assist me? Tor was shut down. This site was accessed via Tor. </p>\n<p>Pharma Lobbyists at work? This is just my grazing knowledge, I'm not hip to how this system works, but I know Big Pharma and if I am looking at that screenshot correctly, I bet they were pissed as fuck! Because let's face it. The government could give a shit about human trafficking. Just imagine if they cared about it like they care about Marijuana?</p>"],[1,10574224,0,2,0,2,"2017-09-22T07:47:40","Hmmm","",[],"<p>There are still places like this on the darknet, just smaller.</p>"],[1,10575953,0,0,0,0,"2017-09-22T13:57:19","ZX4jBXu","",[],"<p>I remember when I had around 40 bitcoins... It was worth about 150 bucks around then. Now it's like 200 grand or something.</p>"]]
