[[0,2144741,0,3,0,3,"2017-09-22T02:50:20","Arrvee","",[],"","CrowdStrike received $100k payments one day after deaths of DNC leaker Seth Rich and process server Shawn Lucas","https://af-mg.com/2017/09/21/breaking-seth-rich-hush-money/","politics"],[1,10572550,0,3,0,3,"2017-09-22T03:00:56","Arrvee","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://www.fec.gov/data/disbursements/?two_year_transaction_period=2016&amp;data_type=processed&amp;committee_id=C00010603&amp;recipient_name=Crowdstrike%2C+Inc.&amp;min_date=01%2F01%2F2015&amp;max_date=12%2F31%2F2016\">The DNC payments to Crowdstrike are on the FEC's website.</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://helenaglass.net/tag/crowdstrike-funders-connected-to-hillary/\">CrowdStrike has three financiers, all connected to the Clinton Foundation.</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It should be noted that Crowdstrike had three funders: \n</p>\n<p>1) Warburg Pincus. Tim Geithner, is president of Warburg Pincus, former Secretary of Treasury under Obama, and formerly worked in the Clinton administration… Uh-oh. Warburg Pincus was a contributor to the DNC and Clinton campaign.</p>\n<p>2) Accel Partners is also a Crowdstrike funder. According to the Clinton Foundation website, Accel is a venture capitalist partner in the Endeavor Investor Network created by the Foundation. Uh-oh.</p>\n<p>3) And the last funder of Crowdstrike is Google Capital, now CapitalG, managed under David Drummond of Google who was instrumental in ‘realigning’ Google search engines to favor Hillary’s campaign. Big uh-oh!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.voanews.com/a/crowdstrike-comey-russia-hack-dnc-clinton-trump/3776067.html\">CrowdStrike is the group that blamed the DNC leak to Wikileaks on Russian hackers.</a></p>\n<p>Remember the Sony hack? <a href=\"https://www.riskbasedsecurity.com/2014/12/a-breakdown-and-analysis-of-the-december-2014-sony-hack/\">CrowdStrike identified the Sony hackers as North Korean.</a> Norse Security had other suspects, they had names of individuals, but they shut up very quickly when CrowdStrike's analysis was accepted. </p>"]]
